OL,3,GNEWSACouncils to use AI to meet #37.6m
OL,4,Afunding gap
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo local authorities will use
OL,7,Fartificial intelligence (AI) to help
OL,8,Fbridge multi-million pound budget gaps.
OL,10,FWest Northamptonshire Council (WNC)
OL,11,Fidentified a #24m budget gap for
OL,12,F2027/28, while North Northamptonshire
OL,13,FCouncil (NNC) will need to find #13.6m.
OL,15,FBoth councils have started cost cutting
OL,16,Fmeasures including using artificial
OL,17,Fintelligence (AI) across services like
OL,18,Fadult social care ` an area where they
OL,19,Fhave previously seen a spending
OL,20,Fincrease.
